<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta foreign exchange market was closed on Friday for the Moslem Eid al-Adha festival. Trading will resume on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, spot rupiah fell to 2,412.0/12.5 at the close in Jakarta from an opening of 2,407.75/08.75. Tomorrow and today rupiah closed at 2,411.75/12.25 and 2,407.75/08.50, respectively.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
